      "target": "# 先明确预期结果，再选择产出\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "2bd8b46e45db952921326a8012f1c4e89a57b69672e92cda09f07bb81884d7a7",
      "target": "> 实现得越快，选错问题的代价就越大。先明确预期结果，让速度用在正确的方向上。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "1183f70bca6aead2ba5908db9eeb62ae57646a098f52a58ac9cab4dcc8ddb9a6",
      "target": "**Type:** Learn + Build\n**Languages:** Python (stdlib)\n**Prerequisites:** 无\n**Time:** ~60 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0006",
