    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "584e52d24f2b17886a76212978741fa03ba6bc6aa292a0331b41402490b42267",
      "target": "## 学习目标\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0009",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "979c56c0b5817394b4315e4b0c3bdcd8860a3da4d3fc413b242823933bb86902",
      "target": "- 写出不预设解决方案的结果框架。\n- 明确用户、情境、当前行为和期望的改变。\n- 明确约束与非目标。\n- 在预设方案固化为工作范围之前，识别它已混入结果描述。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "ee3ee41cda81144a9cbb8853780c50810079ed77bb2d8d37604d84ee1490047b",
      "target": "## 产出不等于结果\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "172956bc2b0fedb18ae84efce39b015b0cc532b470165058a5d222505c167a3c",
      "target": "“构建一个事件处理助手”说的是产出（output）。它并未说明谁需要它、哪些方面会改善，或哪些方面必须保持安全。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "11333181333f735f0696b2fd6862396700eb84abe282d9ff9c7b517aa6fdfe13",
      "target": "结果框架（outcome frame）会这样描述：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0017",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "7b4c9af98b6e19de4291fadd922b073010907a7191123aca0a676e2f7b0996cd",
      "target": "> 当生产告警到来时，值班工程师能在两分钟内识别故障服务，并确定一个安全的下一步行动，同时确保诊断过程保持只读且可审计。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "093dbd396b95ab6debac16d08c4acf4796ee431a373d348983465ebda0fbad15",
      "target": "软件、操作手册（runbook）、一次数据修复，或者一次更小的界面改动，都可能满足这句话描述的要求。它让团队始终关注结果，而不是某个人最先设想的产物。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Output Is Not Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## The Six-Part Frame"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "dfc649250be992a22c39a536315df70d5f64791bd4e6be8336e62fa73a05eb35",
      "target": "## 六要素框架\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## The Six-Part Frame"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0023",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## The Six-Part Frame"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "f8731928a8030b7c4af9d6b27c1b877c6394ca48b6f76973df2f82fad212437f",
      "target": "| 要素 | 问题 |\n|---|---|\n| 用户 | 谁直接面临这个问题？ |\n| 情境 | 问题在何时、何地出现？ |\n| 当前行为 | 目前会发生什么，包括人们采取的变通办法？ |\n| 期望结果 | 哪种可观察的状态应当改善？ |\n| 约束 | 哪些安全、政策、成本或兼容性限制是固定的？ |\n| 非目标 | 哪些有吸引力的相邻工作不在范围内？ |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## The Six-Part Frame"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0025",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## The Six-Part Frame"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "ed3a0ec35da4d1790688f28cefc3514085fddd9d45a9601a293aa7a2a5232ae7",
      "target": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  U[User and situation] --> C[Current behavior]\n  C --> O[Desired outcome]\n  O --> K[Constraints]\n  K --> N[Non-goals]\n  N --> E[Evidence question]\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## The Six-Part Frame"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Find Solution Leakage"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "334052cc476dc014f5ab2a976904edf82c049d682766ac60e2ffd2c82cb07613",
      "target": "## 找出混入的预设方案\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Find Solution Leakage"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Find Solution Leakage"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "38f4245231bd30cb74d59f940ca3eb1fd20745da61f89743a70e4c2fcb1102bf",
      "target": "如果结果描述中包含尚未得到证据支持的产品形态、界面、模型选择、框架或架构，就发生了预设方案混入（solution leakage）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Find Solution Leakage"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0031",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Find Solution Leakage"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "77367f7882c85fa603a43027147f6a1708d4cd2863b0389a751c1823ec55caa9",
      "target": "- “用户每周收到一份 AI 摘要”预设了摘要这一形式及其发送频率。\n- “用户在批准之前了解账户变更”描述的是结果。\n- “部署一个向量数据库”预设了基础设施。\n- “审核时能够获取相关的政策证据”描述的是一种能力。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Find Solution Leakage"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Find Solution Leakage"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "a267079a6324dbc997733e271a1575b69ae6fba8dfaf82de631d055adfec9dc9",
      "target": "当兼容性确实限定了技术选择时，约束可以写明所用技术。要记录这一选择为何是固定的。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Find Solution Leakage"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Constraints Protect the Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "814bcfed6dac7378f0c8aa6f5a201aecce35cc1b7b9438b53489c13c9142481a",
      "target": "## 约束保护预期结果\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Constraints Protect the Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Constraints Protect the Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "d26a72682589518363fe3ce87322258ddd23476f6ad57c4729ddf32aba0b5317",
      "target": "约束不是实现细节，而是现实目标的一部分：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Constraints Protect the Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0039",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Constraints Protect the Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "9071783609eed593c6a4a2143d4f2192fc9b182a3a2bacfb4000ec36782daeac",
      "target": "- 诊断期间不向生产环境写入；\n- 在事件处置的时间预算内作出响应；\n- 现有审计事件仍然具有权威性；\n- 不新增运行时依赖；\n- 无障碍功能的行为保持完整。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Constraints Protect the Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Constraints Protect the Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "d044c8bc12fb35be2aea9e2b5a3fb3126294a39883083a9bb917bb9657373529",
      "target": "如果实现是靠违反约束来达成结果，那就没有真正达成结果。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Constraints Protect the Outcome"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Non-Goals Create a Boundary"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "5b736db15e3b78fae564e2ac3bae083bc3a9639faa3efebf8e8b6b8c430c407e",
      "target": "## 非目标划定边界\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Non-Goals Create a Boundary"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Non-Goals Create a Boundary"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "db88faf2f8485b93ceef8efc5db4e56ce14030f3181a485401148ba2bb6ecdfe",
      "target": "非目标能防止一项范围有限的有用工作逐渐变成一个平台。好的非目标要足够具体，能够据此拒绝不在范围内的工作：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0046",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Non-Goals Create a Boundary"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-47:b0047",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Define the Outcome Before You Choose the Output",
        "## Non-Goals Create a Boundary"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "5a87a58f0418ea88348f1c44e4980ede3216d9fcc6efb8ca48ce6953d7d95a65",
