      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "7fa935ff5b77962f39230337ab86368ae4e110ed0bc686b153777f6b8ecdb78e",
      "target": "将期望结果改成“use the incident assistant”。校验器应当提示：拟议产出已经混入了结果描述。\n"
    },
