      "source_sha256": "fb5e035668e864e5f056b983d649156b8b3334097e17fc1e00a6a2f07cba9546",
      "target": "- [Nuseibeh and Easterbrook, Requirements Engineering: A Roadmap](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~sme/papers/2000/ICSE2000.pdf)，介绍如何将现实世界的目标作为软件工作的依据。\n- [Dardenne, van Lamsweerde, and Fickas, Goal-Directed Requirements Acquisition](https://doi.org/10.1016/0167-6423(93)90021-G)，介绍如何将高层目标细化为约束和可操作的需求。\n"
